OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fbreezy with showers, some heavy with a
OL,7,Frisk of hail this evening. Showers
OL,8,Feasing from the west overnight,
OL,9,Falthough it will remain rather cloudy
OL,10,Fwith a few lingering showers, chiefly
OL,11,Facross East Anglia by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FEarly cloud breaking to sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Breezy with scattered showers
OL,15,Faround lunchtime, perhaps heavy.
OL,16,FShowers slowly easing from the west
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon, with winds
OL,18,Ffalling lighter through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
