OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Tuesday, although a few showers
OL,7,Faround. Rather windy Wednesday, with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain, occasionally heavy.
OL,9,FLikely drier Thursday, but still
OL,10,Fwindy. Daytime temperatures near
OL,11,Fnormal, but warm overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
